{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24128","headline":"洛下送牛相公出镇淮南 · 白居易","name":"洛下送牛相公出镇淮南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北阙至东京，风光十六程。\n坐移丞相阁，春入广陵城。\n红斾拥双节，白须无一茎。\n万人开路看，百吏立班迎。\n阃外君弥重，尊前我亦荣。\n何须身自得，将相是门生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}